>1. When I tried to call a long sword Excalibur,
>   the game replies "Somehow you can't seem to engrave that word."
>   What do I need to do?

	I can help with this one. If you have a long sword, dip it into a 
fountain. If you're lucky, a hand will reach up from the murky depths
and bless it. It will then be Excalibur. It may not work the first time,
and you may ruin your long sword in the process.(it will rust). You can 
keep trying the same fountain also, unless it dries up. Good luck.  

